WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.485
I pushed harder to solve a customer problem,

00:00:03.485 --> 00:00:06.275
and ended up making collaboration harder.

00:00:06.275 --> 00:00:09.924
I was asking sibling teams to commit capacity.

00:00:09.924 --> 00:00:12.337
Their leaders were already stretched,

00:00:12.337 --> 00:00:16.221
and I kept pushing before I really understood their priorities.

00:00:16.221 --> 00:00:18.735
We focus on our own problems.

00:00:18.735 --> 00:00:23.147
We know all the details, so they feel bigger and more urgent.

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:26.689
But we don't have the same visibility into other teams' problems.

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:31.906
They can seem less important, simply because we know less about them.

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:36.263
As we become more senior, we need to make an extra effort

00:00:36.263 --> 00:00:39.298
to understand those other perspectives.

00:00:39.298 --> 00:00:42.650
So before pushing for commitment, ask:

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.864
Can we understand the problems we are trying to solve,

00:00:45.864 --> 00:00:50.197
and work out what matters most for the organization?
